steps.instructions:
Add a check that compares the final total against the expected value you wrote in step 1, and prints PASS or FAIL. You have not been taught if/else as code yet - Chapter 2 does that - so here is the exact shape, the same one lesson 1.5.40 showed you:

if (total.toFixed(2) === "YOUR EXPECTED VALUE") {
  console.log("PASS");
} else {
  console.log("FAIL - got " + total);
}

Copy it and put your own expected value in the quotes.
